#: 0ad
msgctxt "0ad"
msgid ""
"0 A.D. (pronounced “zero-ey-dee”) is a free, open-source, historical Real "
"Time Strategy (RTS) game currently under development by Wildfire Games, a "
"global group of volunteer game developers. As the leader of an ancient "
"civilization, you must gather the resources you need to  raise a military "
"force and dominate your enemies.\n"
" \n"
" This is the official AppImage."
msgstr ""
"0 A.D. (pronounced “zero-ey-dee”) is a free, open-source, historical Real "
"Time Strategy (RTS) game currently under development by Wildfire Games, a "
"global group of volunteer game developers. As the leader of an ancient "
"civilization, you must gather the resources you need to  raise a military "
"force and dominate your enemies.\n"
" \n"
" This is the official AppImage."

