"- Scroll bar marks\n"
"- Line modification indicators\n"
"- Line numbers\n"
"- Code folding\n"
"- Highlighting support for over 400 languages\n"
"- Bracket matching\n"
"- Smart on-the-fly spell checking\n"
"- Highlighting of selected words\n"
