msgctxt "ksnakeduel"
msgid ""
"Snake race game. The object of the game is to avoid running into walls, your "
"own tail, and that of your opponent, while at the same time you have to try  "
"to get your opponent to run into them.\n"
" \n"
" It also includes kdesnake, a special mode of the game where you can play "
"the  classical snake action game. In snake you steer a snake which has to "
"eat food. While eating, the snake grows. But once a player collides with the "
"other  snake or  the wall, the game is lost. This becomes, of course, more "
"and more difficult the longer the snakes grow.\n"
" \n"
" This game is part of the KDE Games suite.\n"
" \n"
" USAGE (from the command line):\n"
" \n"
"           kdegames -h (shows the list of games)\n"
"           kdegames $GAME (launches the selected game)"
msgstr ""
