"launcher as well, **and it will also use the proprietary nvidia driver from "
"the host**.\n"
"\n"
"This project is for demonstration and testing purposes ONLY, to promote this "
"packaging format to turikhay. Consider this package as \"experimental\" or "
"\"testing\". I also invite you to request him to release an official "
"AppImage, and if he agrees, you can show this repository as a proof of "
"concept.\n"
"This project is licensed under the GPL-3.0-only license.\n"
"\n"
"Legacy Launcher is created by turikhay, and is in no way affiliated with "
"Mojang Studios, nor should it be considered a project endorsed by Mojang "
"Studios. This project is community-maintained and is not affiliated with, "
"supported, or endorsed by turikhay or Mojang Studios."
msgstr ""
